{"3775510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duckoleon", "steam_appid": 3775510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4701730], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Napoleonic Wars meet...ducks?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duckoleon is calling you into battle! Barrage your opponents with cannon and musket fire, Get up close and personal with bayonets, sabres and cavalry, play military instruments like drums or the fife and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.poster.avif?t=1785974781\" width=800 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.webm?t=1785974781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.mp4?t=1785974781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME IS STILL EARLY IN DEVELOPMENT! THERE'S A LOT MORE CONTENT ON THE WAY, THESE ARE ONLY EARLY ACCESS FEATURES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutliple nations  to choose from:</strong> France, Prussia, Great Britain, Habsburg empire, Russia, Kingdom of Italy, Confederation of the Rhine, Denmark, Spain and Duchy of Warsaw.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of regiments from the Napoleonic Wars</strong> with beautiful uniforms and flags!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different soldier classes with special abilities:</strong> fusiliers, grenadiers, light infantry, cavalry ranging from lancers to hussars and cuirassiers, artillery, sappers, musical instruments...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple maps inspired by the Napoleonic wars</strong> like Leipzig, Eylau and Austerlitz!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A casual mode as well as an organized competetive mode</strong> for larger battles where you can enlist into your favourite regiments and rank your way up to become an officer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes to choose from like Siege, Line battle and Domination!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of duck, goose and swan breeds</strong> like the mallard, northern pintail, pekin and muscovy ducks.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Napoleonic Wars meet...ducks?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duckoleon is calling you into battle! Barrage your opponents with cannon and musket fire, Get up close and personal with bayonets, sabres and cavalry, play military instruments like drums or the fife and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.poster.avif?t=1785974781\" width=800 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.webm?t=1785974781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.mp4?t=1785974781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME IS STILL EARLY IN DEVELOPMENT! THERE'S A LOT MORE CONTENT ON THE WAY, THESE ARE ONLY EARLY ACCESS FEATURES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutliple nations  to choose from:</strong> France, Prussia, Great Britain, Habsburg empire, Russia, Kingdom of Italy, Confederation of the Rhine, Denmark, Spain and Duchy of Warsaw.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of regiments from the Napoleonic Wars</strong> with beautiful uniforms and flags!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different soldier classes with special abilities:</strong> fusiliers, grenadiers, light infantry, cavalry ranging from lancers to hussars and cuirassiers, artillery, sappers, musical instruments...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple maps inspired by the Napoleonic wars</strong> like Leipzig, Eylau and Austerlitz!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A casual mode as well as an organized competetive mode</strong> for larger battles where you can enlist into your favourite regiments and rank your way up to become an officer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes to choose from like Siege, Line battle and Domination!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of duck, goose and swan breeds</strong> like the mallard, northern pintail, pekin and muscovy ducks.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Experience (mildly) accurate historical battles from the Napoleonic era, but from the perspective of DUCKS! Duckoleon is a multiplayer FPS/TPS with strategic elements. Exciting combat with units ranging from line infantry to cavalry and artillery, historical uniforms, cute ducks and much more!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Slovak, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/8cc5649d4ec9601f2491dc3a3d